OL,3,GNEWSAMurder-accused denies using knife
OL,4,Aon stabbed teen
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 16-year-old boy has told a murder
OL,7,Ftrial that he decided to plan a
OL,8,Fknifepoint robbery of a fellow teenager
OL,9,Fbut did not stab him.
OL,11,FLuis Guembes, 15, died in Stoke Park,
OL,12,FGuildford on 19 January after he was
OL,13,Fstabbed in the head, shoulder and lower
OL,14,Fback.
OL,16,FTwo boys, aged 15 and 16 at the time,
OL,17,Fdeny murdering Guembes and are on trial
OL,18,Fat Guildford Crown Court. They cannot
OL,19,Fbe named due to their age.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
