OL,3,GNEWSAMurder-accused denies using knife
OL,4,Aon stabbed teen
OL,5,
OL,6,FOne defendant, the second to testify,
OL,7,Ftold jurors on Tuesday that Guembes had
OL,8,Fdamaged his phone months earlier while
OL,9,Fexploring a World War Two air raid
OL,10,Fshelter and owed him #40.
